---
title: "claimTokenAllocation (LegionPreLiquidApprovedSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_paused: investor calls claimTokenAllocation(allocationSig, vestingSig)
    q_check_paused --> q_revert_paused: contract paused
    q_check_paused --> q_check_supplied: contract not paused
    q_revert_paused --> [*]: revert ContractPaused
    q_check_supplied --> q_revert_not_supplied: tokensSupplied == false
    q_check_supplied --> q_verify_alloc_sig: tokensSupplied == true
    q_revert_not_supplied --> [*]: revert TokensNotSupplied
    q_verify_alloc_sig --> q_revert_alloc_sig: allocation signature invalid or replayed
    q_verify_alloc_sig --> q_verify_vest_sig: allocation signature valid
    q_revert_alloc_sig --> [*]: revert InvalidAllocationSignature
    q_verify_vest_sig --> q_revert_vest_sig: vesting signature invalid or replayed
    q_verify_vest_sig --> q_check_settled: vesting signature valid
    q_revert_vest_sig --> [*]: revert InvalidVestingSignature
    q_check_settled --> q_revert_settled: position.hasSettled == true
    q_check_settled --> q_calc_tokens: position.hasSettled == false
    q_revert_settled --> [*]: revert AlreadyClaimed
    q_calc_tokens --> q_check_vesting: tokenAllocation = position.investedCapital * position.cachedTokenAllocationRate / 1e18
    q_check_vesting --> q_deploy_vesting: vestingRequired (time-locked portion > 0)
    q_check_vesting --> q_transfer_direct: no vesting required (fully immediate)
    q_deploy_vesting --> q_transfer_vested: deploy vesting contract clone, position.vestingAddress = vestingContract
    q_transfer_vested --> q_transfer_immediate: transfer vestedAmount askToken to vestingContract
    q_transfer_immediate --> q_mark: transfer immediateAmount askToken to investor
    q_transfer_direct --> q_mark: transfer tokenAllocation askToken to investor
    q_mark --> q_mark_sigs: position.hasSettled = true
    q_mark_sigs --> q_emit: mark both signatures as used
    q_emit --> [*]: emit TokenAllocationClaimed(investor, tokenAllocation, vestingAddress)

    note right of q_calc_tokens
        INV-001: tokenAllocation = investedCapital * cachedTokenAllocationRate / 1e18
        INV-002: cachedTokenAllocationRate uses 18 decimal precision
        INV-003: Dual signature required: allocation + vesting terms
        INV-004: Vesting contract deployed as clone (minimal proxy pattern)
        INV-005: hasSettled prevents double-claiming of token allocation
    end note
